{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":14836,\"title\":\"Coraline\",\"tagline\":\"Be careful what you wish for.\",\"overview\":\"Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":9801,\"year\":2009,\"runtime\":100,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":60000000,\"revenue\":185860104,\"director\":\"Henry Selick\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":57646,\"name\":\"Henry Selick\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2LvtcpV8njWrp2W9eXmTNjsAWev.jpg\"},{\"id\":501,\"name\":\"Dakota Fanning\",\"character\":\"Coraline Jones (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hwcO08SVWkelfvgfIa5HsTMxsK8.jpg\"},{\"id\":10742,\"name\":\"Teri Hatcher\",\"character\":\"Mel Jones / Other Mother (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ySmnfZm8ZGabcwp4UwaMDeSzXqx.jpg\"},{\"id\":12094,\"name\":\"Jennifer Saunders\",\"character\":\"Miss April Spink / Other Spink (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pTgxwHcz9L8SNVYvPJS0o0lgHya.jpg\"},{\"id\":5539,\"name\":\"Dawn French\",\"character\":\"Miss Miriam Forcible / Other Forcible (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2hhh91WwDWDSNaqYLdjIlakkrif.jpg\"},{\"id\":65827,\"name\":\"Keith David\",\"character\":\"The Cat (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jJLJuR7FNHYL1fB5igjj7IXzOel.jpg\"},{\"id\":77344,\"name\":\"John Hodgman\",\"character\":\"Charlie Jones / Other Father (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xlgpI6x1OECW6V7